ite, flashcards with spaced repetition, your notes and your progress.

Gradify Pro is the part that organises your learning for you: less time decid=
ing what to revise, and more time revising it.

SMART PLAN: know exactly what to do tonight
Gradify fits each session into your free time: mistakes that keep coming back=
 first, then what's fading, then the next step up. Miss a day and it replans,=
 without cramming.

READINESS FORECASTS: see how ready you really are
An honest estimate with a range, built from your own answers, and how many mi=
nutes a day it takes to reach your target by exam day.

REVISION RECOMMENDATIONS: everything worth doing, best first
Your revision ranked by how much each step will move your learning, and every=
 recommendation tells you why it's there.

